---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const seo = {
  title: "About Arthavi | Best Portfolio Tracker for Indian Investors",
  description: "Discover Arthavi, the privacy-first portfolio tracker for Indian investors to track Mutual Funds and Stocks. Ad-free, secure, and built for accurate Net Worth & XIRR analytics.",
};
---
<Layout
  title={seo.title}
  description={seo.description}
  keywords="portfolio tracker India, best mutual fund tracker, Indian investor tools, privacy focused investment app, ad-free portfolio analytics"
  schema={JSON.stringify({
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": "Arthavi",
    "url": "https://arthavi.com",
    "logo": "https://arthavi.com/images/logo.png",
    "foundingDate": "2024",
    "description": "Privacy-focused portfolio analytics platform for Indian investors to track Mutual Funds and Stocks with AI-powered insights.",
    "founder": {
      "@type": "Person",
      "name": "Tejas Chaudhari",
      "url": "https://tejaschaudhari.com",
      "jobTitle": "Founder & Lead Developer",
      "knowsAbout": ["JavaScript", "TypeScript", "React", "Node.js", "Portfolio Analytics", "XIRR Calculations"],
      "description": "Full Stack Developer with 7+ years of experience building production-grade web applications. Started coding at age 10 in 2011."
    },
    "sameAs": [
        "https://twitter.com/arthavi_app",
        "https://www.instagram.com/arthavi.app",
        "https://github.com/tejaschaudhari",
        "https://linkedin.com/in/tejaschaudhari"
      ]
    })}
  breadcrumb={{
    items: [
      { name: "Home", url: "https://arthavi.com/" },
      { name: "About", url: "https://arthavi.com/about" }
    ]
  }}
>

    <main class="container">
        <div class="page-header fade-in">
            <h1>Our Mission: Clarity for Indian Investors</h1>
            <p class="text-muted" style="font-size: 1.2rem;">Building the gold standard for unbiased, ad-free portfolio
                tracking in India.</p>
        </div>

        <article class="prose fade-in delay-100">
            <h2>The Problem</h2>
            <p>I was tired of juggling different apps to see my total investment returns. I was juggling multiple apps
                and wanted a better, privacy-first way to track my portfolio without linking demat accounts.</p>

            <h2>The Journey</h2>
            <p>I planned and built this entire app in 1 month to solve my own problem.</p>

            <h2>The Solution</h2>
            <p>A unified dashboard for Indian Mutual Funds and NSE/BSE stocks that focuses on privacy and manual
                tracking.</p>

            <h2>Who We Are</h2>
            <p>Arthavi was founded on a simple yet powerful premise: <strong>Indian retail investors deserve better
                    data.</strong> In a financial landscape dominated by broker-owned platforms and ad-heavy free tools,
                clarity is often the first casualty. We set out to build the best portfolio analytics app for Indian
                investors—one that serves the user, not the intermediary.</p>
            <p>We are a team of engineers and finance enthusiasts who believe that net worth tracking should be private,
                accurate, and completely devoid of conflicts of interest.</p>

            <h2>The Founder</h2>
            <div class="founder-card glass-panel" style="padding: 2rem; margin: 1.5rem 0; border-radius: 12px; display: flex; gap: 2rem; align-items: flex-start; flex-wrap: wrap;">
                <div style="width: 80px; height: 80px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6366f1, #8b5cf6); border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0;">
                    <span style="font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 700; color: white;">T</span>
                </div>
                <div style="flex: 1; min-width: 280px;">
                    <h3 style="margin-bottom: 0.25rem;">Tejas Chaudhari</h3>
                    <p style="color: var(--primary); font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">Founder & Lead Developer</p>
                    <p style="color: var(--text-body); font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Full Stack Developer with 7+ years of experience building production-grade web applications. Started coding at age 10 in 2011 with Visual Basic, now specializing in React, Vue, Next.js and Node.js. Built Arthavi to solve personal portfolio tracking challenges with a privacy-first approach.</p>
                    <div style="display: flex; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap;">
                        <a href="https://tejaschaudhari.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: var(--primary); font-size: 0.9rem; text-decoration: none; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem;">
                            Portfolio <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><line x1="10" y1="14" x2="21" y2="3"></line></svg>
                        </a>
                        <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/tejaschaudhari" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: var(--primary); font-size: 0.9rem; text-decoration: none;">LinkedIn</a>
                        <a href="https://github.com/tejaschaudhari" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: var(--primary); font-size: 0.9rem; text-decoration: none;">GitHub</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <h2>Why We Built Arthavi</h2>
            <p>Most "free" portfolio trackers in India are actually lead-generation engines. They sell your data to
                lenders, push "recommended" regular mutual funds that pay commissions, or clutter your screen with ads.
                We rejected that model entirely.</p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>No Commissions:</strong> We made a conscious choice not to sell mutual funds or stocks. This
                    ensures our <a href="/#features">portfolio analytics</a> remain 100% unbiased.</li>
                <li><strong>Privacy First:</strong> Your financial data is sensitive. We architected Arthavi to ensure
                    no third-party ever gets access to your portfolio.</li>
                <li><strong>Indian Context:</strong> We built specific features for the Indian market, like <strong>CAS
                        PDF parsing</strong> (for CAMS/KFintech), <strong>XIRR Validation</strong>, and support for
                    NSE/BSE stocks.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>What Arthavi Is & Is Not</h2>
            <p>To maintain complete transparency with our users, clarifying our role is essential:</p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>We are NOT a Broker:</strong> We do not execute trades, open demat accounts, or hold your
                    money. We are a pure <em>portfolio tracker/analytics tool</em>.</li>
                <li><strong>We are NOT an Investment Advisor:</strong> We provide data visualization and performance
                    metrics (like XIRR and allocation), not buy/sell recommendations.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>Our Commitment to Privacy</h2>
            <p>We are committed to maintaining a clean, ad-free environment forever. Our business model relies on
                premium analytics features, not on selling your attention or your data to the highest bidder. Learn more
                about our data practices on our <a href="/security">Security page</a> and <a
                    href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
        </article>
    </main>

    
    

</Layout>
